        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8455, Modern Single Cylinder Low Profile Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Single Cylinder Low Profile Deadbolt made by Emtek has a mere 7/8 inch exterior projection and a 1-1/4 inch interior trim projection. It has a classic appearance that can transform from modern to traditional simply by selecting a finish. This easy to install single cylinder deadbolt will fit standard door hole preparations. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. \r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek 8455 Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Diameter with Exterior Ring: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Diameter without Exterior Ring: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Projection with Exterior Ring: 7/8”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Projection without Exterior Ring: 5/8”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Thickness: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
