                "title": "Single Cylinder Low Profile Deadbolt, Emtek 8455",
                "description": "Emtek 8455, Single Cylinder Low Profile Deadbolt - The Single Cylinder Low Profile Deadbolt made by Emtek has a mere 7/8 inch exterior projection and a 1-1/4 inch interior trim projection. It has a classic appearance that can transform from modern to traditional simply by selecting a finish. This easy to install single cylinder deadbolt will fit standard door hole preparations.",
